# Strictly straight nephron centerline for terminal-boundary tests.
# Coordinates and radii below are in micrometres (um).
# Geometry: 840 um long, aligned with +z, with a constant 15 um lumen radius.
# Use with -radius 15 -membraneThickness 2 -BoxRefs 4 -useTraceEndpoints 1.
# The endpoint mode creates the OuterWall metadata, puts the endpoints on the
# inlet/outlet faces, and translates the box grid instead of bending this trace.
